\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 This program simulates a triangular robot that explores an unknown grid world containing randomly placed obstacles and markers. At the start, the robot knows nothing about the environment; it discovers the map by moving and updating its internal knowledge of free and blocked cells. Whenever it steps on a marker, it picks it up automatically. The robot systematically searches until all reachable space has been explored, then navigates to the nearest reachable corner of the arena and drops all collected markers in one stack.\
 \
To compile the program: gcc cw.c graphics.c -o cw\
To execute the program: ./cw | java -jar drawapp-4.5.jar}